      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1 data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"543\">🧱 THE HEX DEVELOPMENT CYCLE — CANON EXAMPLE</h1><blockquote data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"606\"><p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"606\">“You don’t conquer land.<br data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"574\" />You convince it to cooperate.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"611\" /><h1 data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"649\">📍 STARTING STATE — WILDERNESS HEX</h1><h3 data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"668\">Initial Flags</h3><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"934\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"690\"><tr data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"690\"><th data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"681\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Property</th><th data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"690\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"934\"><tr data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"733\"><td data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"719\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Type</td><td data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">wilderness</td></tr><tr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"749\"><td data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"741\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Size</td><td data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">none</td></tr><tr data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"778\"><td data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"763\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Population</td><td data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"778\" data-col-size=\"sm\">uninhabited</td></tr><tr data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"801\"><td data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Status</td><td data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"801\" data-col-size=\"sm\">unclaimed</td></tr><tr data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"825\"><td data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"816\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Integration</td><td data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0 / 6</td></tr><tr data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"846\"><td data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"838\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Modifiers</td><td data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"846\" data-col-size=\"sm\">none</td></tr><tr data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"887\"><td data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"859\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Resources</td><td data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"887\" data-col-size=\"sm\">minimal (from TYPE_BASE)</td></tr><tr data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"903\"><td data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"898\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Loyalty</td><td data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"903\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0</td></tr><tr data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"934\"><td data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Darkness</td><td data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"934\" data-col-size=\"sm\">region baseline</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h3 data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"956\">What It Produces</h3><p data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"978\">From terrain engine:</p><ul data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1112\"><li data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1026\"><p data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1026\">Wilderness generates minimal materials/food.</p></li><li data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1076\"><p data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1076\">Converts into low OP via resource → OP mapping.</p></li><li data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1096\"><p data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1096\">No Loyalty bonus.</p></li><li data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1112\"><p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1112\">No cap bonus.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1134\"><strong data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1134\">Mal Translation:</strong></p><blockquote data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1183\"><p data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1183\">“It does not know you. It does not feed you.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1188\" /><h1 data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1223\">🏗 STAGE 1 — FOOTHOLD / OUTPOST</h1><p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1237\">You execute:</p><ul data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1330\"><li data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1272\"><p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1272\"><strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1270\">Reconstruction Drive (T2)</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1302\"><p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1302\">Or found_site_* strategic</p></li><li data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1330\"><p data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1330\">Spend Economy + SoftPower</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1354\">Mechanical Changes</h3><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1575\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1375\"><tr data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1375\"><th data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1365\" data-col-size=\"sm\">System</th><th data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1375\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1575\"><tr data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1416\"><td data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1405\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Status</td><td data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1416\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Claimed</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1438\"><td data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1431\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Integration</td><td data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1438\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1–2</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1463\"><td data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1452\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Population</td><td data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outpost</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1509\"><td data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1476\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Resources</td><td data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1509\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Type × Size multiplier begins</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1527\"><td data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1520\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Loyalty</td><td data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1527\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1–2</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1575\"><td data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1547\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logistics Demand</td><td data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Begins counting distance</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h3 data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1590\">OP Impact</h3><ul data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1705\"><li data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1637\"><p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1637\">Food/Materials begin meaningful production.</p></li><li data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1667\"><p data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1667\">Economy OP regen increases.</p></li><li data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1705\"><p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1705\">Logistics regen impacted if remote.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1715\">Risk</h3><p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1747\">If you do not assign garrison:</p><ul data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1804\"><li data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1778\"><p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1778\">Infiltration vulnerability.</p></li><li data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1804\"><p data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1804\">Possible Loyalty decay.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1826\"><strong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1826\">Mal Translation:</strong></p><blockquote data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1867\"><p data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1867\">“You plant a flag. The land watches.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1872\" /><h1 data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1927\">🧱 STAGE 2 — DEVELOPING TERRITORY (Integration 3–4)</h1><p data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1939\">You apply:</p><ul data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2027\"><li data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1957\"><p data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1957\">Harvest Season</p></li><li data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1971\"><p data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1971\">Civic Audit</p></li><li data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1993\"><p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1993\">Ration Distribution</p></li><li data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2009\"><p data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2009\">Border Patrol</p></li><li data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2027\"><p data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2027\">Training Drills</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2051\">Mechanical Changes</h3><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2294\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2072\"><tr data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2072\"><th data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2062\" data-col-size=\"sm\">System</th><th data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2072\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2294\"><tr data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2114\"><td data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2107\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Integration</td><td data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2114\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3–4</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2144\"><td data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2125\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Loyalty</td><td data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2144\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stabilizes (3+)</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2185\"><td data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2157\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Modifiers</td><td data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2185\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Well-Maintained possible</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2226\"><td data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2204\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Resource Output</td><td data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2226\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Multiplied by size</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2261\"><td data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2238\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OP Regen</td><td data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Noticeable increase</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2294\"><td data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2281\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logistics Demand</td><td data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2294\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Increased</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h3 data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2321\">Logistics Interaction</h3><p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2362\">If total hex count expands too quickly:</p><ul data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2424\"><li data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2394\"><p data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2394\">Overextension Band triggered</p></li><li data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2424\"><p data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2424\">−10% / −20% / −35% OP regen</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2480\">This is the first point where expansion can choke you.</p><p data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2502\"><strong data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2502\">Mal Translation:</strong></p><blockquote data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2552\"><p data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2552\">“Growth without supply is a future rebellion.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2557\" /><h1 data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2606\">🏙 STAGE 3 — SETTLED PROVINCE (Integration 5)</h1><p data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2620\">You execute:</p><ul data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2708\"><li data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2641\"><p data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2641\">Cultural Exchange</p></li><li data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2661\"><p data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2661\">Sanctum Expansion</p></li><li data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2680\"><p data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2680\">Justice Tribunal</p></li><li data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2708\"><p data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2708\">Spy Insertion (defensive)</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2732\">Mechanical Changes</h3><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2949\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2753\"><tr data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2753\"><th data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2743\" data-col-size=\"sm\">System</th><th data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2753\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2949\"><tr data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2793\"><td data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Integration</td><td data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2793\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2825\"><td data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2807\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Population</td><td data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2825\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Village / Town</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2842\"><td data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2836\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Loyalty</td><td data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2842\" data-col-size=\"sm\">5+</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2870\"><td data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2870\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Blessed Ground possible</td><td data-col-size=\"sm\"></td></tr><tr data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2908\"><td data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2908\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Darkness regen −1 (if sanctified)</td><td data-col-size=\"sm\"></td></tr><tr data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2949\"><td data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2925\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strategic Cap</td><td data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2949\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Increased OP ceiling</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h3 data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2975\">Garrison Requirement</h3><p data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3003\">If garrison upkeep unpaid:</p><ul data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3073\"><li data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3020\"><p data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3020\">Loyalty drops</p></li><li data-start=\"3021\" data-end=\"3034\"><p data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3034\">Morale drop</p></li><li data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3073\"><p data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3073\">Possible Hostile Population modifier</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3118\">Garrison Upkeep Engine drains OP each turn.</p><p data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3135\">Failure to pay:</p><ul data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3196\"><li data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3159\"><p data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3159\">Structural penalties</p></li><li data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3196\"><p data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3196\">Eventually, integration regression</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3218\"><strong data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3218\">Mal Translation:</strong></p><blockquote data-start=\"3220\" data-end=\"3269\"><p data-start=\"3222\" data-end=\"3269\">“The city must be fed — or it feeds on itself.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3274\" /><h1 data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3327\">🏛 STAGE 4 — INTEGRATED HEARTLAND (Integration 6)</h1><p data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3354\">Full integration reached.</p><h3 data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3379\">Mechanical Benefits</h3><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3574\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3400\"><tr data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3400\"><th data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3390\" data-col-size=\"sm\">System</th><th data-start=\"3390\" data-end=\"3400\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3574\"><tr data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3440\"><td data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Integration</td><td data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3440\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3461\"><td data-start=\"3441\" data-end=\"3451\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Loyalty</td><td data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3461\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stable</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3486\"><td data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3473\" data-col-size=\"sm\">OP Regen</td><td data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3486\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Optimized</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3538\"><td data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logistics Efficiency</td><td data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3538\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reduced internal penalty</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3574\"><td data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3567\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Development Locked Option</td><td data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3574\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3590\">At this point:</p><ul data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3690\"><li data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3621\"><p data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3621\">Hex contributes full value.</p></li><li data-start=\"3622\" data-end=\"3655\"><p data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3655\">Vulnerable only to major raids.</p></li><li data-start=\"3656\" data-end=\"3690\"><p data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3690\">Can support advanced strategics.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3695\" /><h1 data-start=\"3697\" data-end=\"3732\">🌳 STAGE 5 — SEPHIROTIC ALIGNMENT</h1><p data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3778\">You align the hex (via ritual or strategic):</p><p data-start=\"3780\" data-end=\"3797\">Example: Tiferet.</p><p data-start=\"3799\" data-end=\"3819\">From terrain engine:</p><p data-start=\"3821\" data-end=\"3872\">Each Sephirot adds flat bonuses before multipliers.</p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"4043\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3895\"><tr data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3895\"><th data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3885\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sephirot</th><th data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3895\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"4043\"><tr data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3962\"><td data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3928\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tiferet</td><td data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3962\" data-col-size=\"sm\">+1 Food, +1 Trade, +1 Military</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3988\"><td data-start=\"3963\" data-end=\"3973\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gevurah</td><td data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"3988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">+3 Military</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"4010\"><td data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"3998\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Chesed</td><td data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">+2 Trade</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4035\"><td data-start=\"4011\" data-end=\"4019\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Binah</td><td data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">+2 Knowledge</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4043\"><td data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">etc</td><td data-col-size=\"sm\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4100\">These are applied before size and modifier multipliers.</p><h3 data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4123\">Mechanical Impact</h3><ul data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4213\"><li data-start=\"4125\" data-end=\"4152\"><p data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4152\">Alters OP generation mix.</p></li><li data-start=\"4153\" data-end=\"4179\"><p data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4179\">Shifts faction identity.</p></li><li data-start=\"4180\" data-end=\"4213\"><p data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4213\">Impacts Ritual success synergy.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4235\"><strong data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4235\">Mal Translation:</strong></p><blockquote data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4292\"><p data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4292\">“The land remembers which face of the Tree it wears.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"4294\" data-end=\"4297\" /><h1 data-start=\"4299\" data-end=\"4338\">🌑 DARKNESS INTERACTION THROUGH CYCLE</h1><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4589\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4365\"><tr data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4365\"><th data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4348\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stage</th><th data-start=\"4348\" data-end=\"4365\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Vulnerability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4589\"><tr data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4424\"><td data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4404\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wilderness</td><td data-start=\"4404\" data-end=\"4424\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Easily corrupted</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4461\"><td data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4435\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Outpost</td><td data-start=\"4435\" data-end=\"4461\" data-col-size=\"sm\">High infiltration risk</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4504\"><td data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4475\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Developing</td><td data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4504\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Casualties raise Darkness</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4542\"><td data-start=\"4505\" data-end=\"4515\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Settled</td><td data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4542\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dark Harvest temptation</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4589\"><td data-start=\"4543\" data-end=\"4556\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Integrated</td><td data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4589\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ritual corruption stakes rise</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"4591\" data-end=\"4634\">If Darkness crosses 10+ during development:</p><ul data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4691\"><li data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4662\"><p data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4662\">Increased Drift pressure</p></li><li data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4691\"><p data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4691\">Spark destabilization risk</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4696\" /><h1 data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4737\">⚖ FAILURE PATH — IF GARRISON NOT PAID</h1><p data-start=\"4739\" data-end=\"4767\">From Garrison Upkeep Engine:</p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"4769\" data-end=\"4961\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-